{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Omni Geode is a ",["l","矿物#Geodes","Mineral deposit"]," found primarily by breaking rocks in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],". It can be broken open at the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]," for 25g or placed in a ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"]," to obtain the items inside. Omni Geodes can contain ",["l","矿物","minerals"],", ",["l","古物","artifacts"],", ores, or basic resources. They can also be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for a variety of items."]],["p",["Note: Neither daily ",["l","运气","luck"]," nor luck ",["l","效果","buffs"]," affect the contents of an Omni Geode."]]]],["Locations",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Rocks in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," (Floors 21+) or ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],"."]],[1,[["l","采矿#Omni Geode Node","Omni Geode Nodes"]," in the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],"."]],[1,[["l","矿井#Crates and Barrels","Crates and barrels"]," in the Mines (Floors 80+), Skull Cavern, or Volcano Dungeon."]],[1,[["l","矿井#Dirt Patches","Dirt patches"]," in the Mines or Skull Cavern."]],[1,[["l","石碳幽灵","Carbon Ghost"]," drop (99% chance)."]],[1,[["l","幽灵头骨","Haunted Skull"]," drop (1.3% chance, only if all ",["l","收集包#Vault","Vault Bundles"]," are not complete)."]],[1,[["l","荒野石魔","Wilderness Golem"]," and ",["l","铱石魔","Iridium Golem"]," drop (5% chance, after reaching ",["l","战斗","Combat"]," Level 5)."]],[1,[["l","淘盘","Panning"]," in any area."]],[1,[["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"],"."]],[1,["1, 3, or 10 Omni Geodes can be produced by an ",["l","章鱼","Octopus"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," when the population reaches 9."]],[1,["Up to 3 can be purchased from the ",["l","绿洲","Oasis"]," on ",["l","周循环#Wednesday","Wednesdays"]," for 500g each."]],[1,["One can be purchased from ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],"' shop on ",["l","周循环#Tuesday","Tuesdays"]," for 300g."]],[1,["5 Omni Geodes are the reward for completing the Boiler Room."]],[1,["3 Omni Geodes are one of the prizes from the ",["l","鳟鱼大赛","Trout Derby"],"."]],[1,["8 Omni Geodes are the 18th prize from the ",["l","镇长的庄园#Prize Machine","Prize Machine"],"."]],[1,["5 or 10 Omni Geodes can be obtained from Skull Cavern ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","treasure rooms"],"."]],[1,["2-4 Omni Geodes may occasionally be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图#Beach","Beach Farm"]," if the player upgraded the ",["l","农舍","Farmhouse"]," at least once."]],[1,["Crane Game in the ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"]," lobby, during any season."]],[1,["The ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," outside of the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"],"."]],[1,["A fallen ",["l","陨石#Meteorite","meteorite"]," on ",["l","农场","the Farm"]," will drop 2 Omni Geodes when mined."]]]]]],["Omni Geode Contents",2,[["p",["It is impossible for the player to receive a Prismatic Shard before cracking at least 15 Omni Geodes. Therefore, the probability of receiving a Prismatic Shard is 0 and receiving any minerals or artifacts is 1/88 if the player has not yet cracked 15 Omni Geodes. The probabilities shown below reflect the probability after cracking at least 15 Omni Geodes."]]]],["Artifacts",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Dwarvish_Helm.png",24]],[["l","矮人头盔","Dwarvish Helm"]],["31/2750"]],[[["f","Dwarf_Gadget.png",24]],[["l","矮人小工具","Dwarf Gadget"]],["31/2750"]],[[["f","Ancient_Drum.png",24]],[["l","古代鼓","Ancient Drum"]],["31/2750"]]]]]],["Foraged Minerals",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Earth_Crystal.png",24]],[["l","地晶","Earth Crystal"]],["1/48"]],[[["f","Frozen_Tear.png",24]],[["l","泪晶","Frozen Tear"]],["1/48"]],[[["f","Fire_Quartz.png",24]],[["l","火水晶","Fire Quartz"]],["1/48"]]]]]],["Gems",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Prismatic_Shard.png",24]],[["l","五彩碎片","Prismatic Shard"]],["1/250"]]]]]],["Geode Minerals",3,[["p",["An Omni Geode can contain any of the 41 ",["l","矿物#Geode Minerals","Geode Minerals"]," in the game. Each has a 31/2750 chance to appear."]]]],["Resources",3,[["p",["Coal, copper ore, iron ore, and gold ore will be obtained in the following amounts: 30% for 1, 30% for 3, 30% for 5, 9% for 10, and 1% for 20. Stone has a 50% chance to use those values and a 50% chance to give only 1. Iridium Ore has a 30% chance for 1, 30% for 2, 30% for 3, 9% for 6, and 1% for 11. Only 1 clay can be obtained from a single geode."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Stone.png",24]],[["l","石头","Stone"]],["1/8"]],[[["f","Clay.png",24]],[["l","粘土","Clay"]],["1/16"]],[[["f","Coal.png",24]],[["l","煤炭","Coal"]],["1/20"]],[[["f","Copper_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铜矿石","Copper Ore"]],["1/20"]],[[["f","Iron_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铁矿石","Iron Ore"]],["1/20"]],[[["f","Gold_Ore.png",24]],[["l","黄金矿石","Gold Ore"]],["1/20"]],[[["f","Iridium_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铱矿石","Iridium Ore"]],["1/20"]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Omni Geode is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Omni Geode can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["f","Shirt264.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝#Shirts","Omni Shirt"],". It can be used as a gray ",["l","染色","dye"]," when used in the spool of the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," with a dyeable clothing item in the feed."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,["2-3 Omni Geodes may be requested by ",["l","章鱼","Octopus"],", ",["l","虹鳟鱼","Rainbow Trout"],", ",["l","幽灵鱼","Spook Fish"],", ",["l","鲟鱼","Sturgeon"],", or ",["l","大海参","Super Cucumber"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 5 to 7."]],[1,[["l","马龙","Marlon"]," may request the player to obtain 12 Omni Geodes in the ",["l","沙漠节#Skull Cavern","\"Treasure Hunt\" quest"]," during the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],"."]]]]]],["Trading",2,[["l",0,[[1,["5 Omni Geodes can be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for 1 ",["l","古物宝藏","Artifact Trove"],"."]],[1,["3 Omni Geodes can be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for 1 ",["l","传送图腾：沙漠","Warp Totem: Desert"],"."]],[1,["50 Omni Geodes can be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for 1 ",["l","绿色头巾","Green Turban"],"."]],[1,["1 Omni Geode can be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for 3 ",["l","干草","Hay"]," on Mondays."]],[1,["333 Omni Geodes can be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for 1 ",["l","魔法头巾","Magic Turban"]," on even-numbered days."]],[1,["333 Omni Geodes can be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for 1 ",["l","魔法牛仔帽","Magic Cowboy Hat"]," on odd-numbered days."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.3.27","1.3.27"],": Can now find ",["l","地晶","Earth Crystal"]," and ",["l","泪晶","Frozen Tear"]," in Omni Geodes."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be obtained from ",["l","电影院#Crane Game","Crane Game"]," in the ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"],". Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". Can be requested in ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quests"],". Can be produced by ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"s. Can now be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for items."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can now be obtained from ",["l","采矿#Omni Geode Node","Omni Geode Nodes"]," in the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]," and ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"],". Can now be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图#Beach","Beach Farm"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Now one of the prizes from the ",["l","鳟鱼大赛","Trout Derby"]," festival. Can now be obtained from ",["l","铱石魔","Iridium Golem"],"s and ",["l","陨石#Meteorite","meteorite"],"s. Added ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," quest. Can now be obtained from the ",["l","镇长的庄园#Prize Machine","Prize Machine"],". Purchase price from the ",["l","绿洲","Oasis"]," decreased from 1,000g to 500g."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6.4","1.6.4"],": Ten Omni Geodes are now a potential reward from Skull Cavern treasure chests."]]]]]]]}